cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: Figure One
abstract: >-
  A browser-based editor for CONSORT and PRISMA participant flow diagrams.
  Boxes and their counts are arranged on a node canvas, and the figure is
  typeset with Typst for export as PDF, SVG or PNG at a chosen resolution.
  Styling covers the details journals ask about, including fonts, digit
  grouping, box fills and arrow forms. A flowchart is stored as a plain JSON
  project file that can be reopened, shared, or kept alongside the manuscript.
type: software
